{
  "id": "section-864",
  "title": "关于军队支持左派的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-244.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>244)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n林彪同志：<br>\n<br>\n　　应派军队支持左派广大群众。请酌处。<br><br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br><br>\n　　一九六七年元月二十一日</p>\n<br>\n　　以后，凡有真正革命派要求军队支持援助，都应该这样做。所谓不介入是假的，早已介入了。此事似应重新发布命令，以前命令作废。请酌。又及。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-243.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-245.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
